# A core that keeps a field over a load: from frame 40 console 0 has a
# latch set that no save state holds. A new process starts with it clear,
# so the from run passes; a load into the running session leaves it set.
# error: trace differs at frame 30 console 0:
console 0 core=test
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_mode stale_load
option 0 link_test_bad_frame 40
0 cable 0:0 1:0
30 save mid
60 end
